prompt_gloss_gg_v1.user_template:
Sentence: {sentence}

Each numbered line shows symbol A and symbol B (name/arity, and one use of it in its formula).
{items}

For each line answer YES if A and B can denote the same concept or relation (same argument roles) in this sentence, else NO. Return ONLY a JSON object mapping each line number to "YES" or "NO", e.g. {{"1": "YES", "2": "NO"}}.

prompt_gloss_gg_gateA_v1.user_template:
Sentence: {sentence}

Each numbered line shows symbol A (a logic atom used in a formalisation of the sentence) and B (an English meaning).
{items}

For each line answer YES if symbol A can denote exactly meaning B (same argument roles) in this sentence, else NO. Return ONLY a JSON object mapping each line number to "YES" or "NO", e.g. {{"1": "YES", "2": "NO"}}.
